{"page": 1530, "total_pages": 1570, "total": 78490, "skills": [{"category": "", "created_at": 1780701190713, "description": "Turn source text, documents, announcements, or research notes into a concise news-style segment for The Daily Catch, hosted by Claudia Crabtree, and optional...", "description_zh": "<think>\nWe needto translate the description into concise Chinese, return JSON only like {\"description_zh\":\"...\"}. The description is:\n\n\"Turn source text, documents, announcements, or research notes into a concise news-style segment for The Daily Catch, hosted by Claudia Crabtree, and optional...\"\n\nBut the description seems incomplete (ends with \"and optional...\").\n\nWeneed to produce Chinese translation in a concise style. The phrase \"Turn source text, documents, announcements, or research notes into a concise news-style segment for The Daily Catch, hosted by Claudia Crabtree,and optional...\" suggests that it's maybe describing a skill to create a brief news segment for a news show, optionallywith something else (maybe \"and optional video\").\n\nWe must produce a JSON object with key \"description_zh\"and value the Chinese translation.\n\nWe need to be concise, probably something like:\n\n\"将源文本、文件、公告或研究笔记转化为《The Daily Catch》节目（由克劳迪娅·克拉布特里主持）的简短新闻片段，可选...\"\n\nBut we might refine: \"将原始文本、文档、公告或研究笔记转化为克劳迪娅·克拉布特里主持的《每日捕捉》节目的简明新闻段落，可选...\" Let's think.\n\nSimplify: \"将源文本、文档、公告或研究笔记转化为克劳迪娅·克拉布特里主持的《The Daily Catch》简明新闻片段，可选...\" Shouldwe include the show name \"The Daily Catch\"? Usually we could keep English. Or translate: \"每日捕获\"? butkeep \"The Daily Catch\".\n\nWe can incorporate \"以及可选...\" maybe \"以及可选的视频或音频\". But not necessary; we could just say \"以及可选的...\" because it's incomplete.\n\nThus translation: \"将源文本、文件、公告或研究笔记转化为克劳迪娅·克拉布特里主持的《The Daily Catch》简明新闻片段，可选...\"\n\nWe must return JSON only. Ensure JSON quotingcorrect. Probably include Chinese characters.\n\nThus final: {\"description_zh\":\"将源文本、文件、公告或研究笔记转化为克劳迪娅·克拉布特里主持的《The Daily Catch》简明新闻片段，可选...\"}\n</think>\n\n```json\n{\"description_zh\":\"将源文本、文件、公告或研究笔记转化为克劳迪娅·克拉布特里主持的《The Daily Catch》简明新闻片段，可选...\"}\n```", "downloads": 64, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/openclaw/daily-catch-newscast-studio", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "The Daily Catch Newscast Studio", "ownerName": "openclaw", "score": 16161.616161616163, "slug": "daily-catch-newscast-studio", "source": "clawhub", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780714494903, "version": "0.1.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1780556092196, "description": "Ticketmaster (ticketmaster.com). Use this skill for ANY Ticketmaster request — searching and reading data. Whenever a task involves Ticketmaster, use this sk...", "description_zh": "Ticketmaster（ticketmaster.com）。用于处理任何 Ticketmaster 请求——搜索和读取数据。只要任务涉及 Ticketmaster，请使用此技能。", "downloads": 64, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/oomol/oo-ticketmaster", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "Ticketmaster", "ownerName": "oomol", "score": 10774.410774410773, "slug": "oo-ticketmaster", "source": "clawhub", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780714494322, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1780555428937, "description": "DataScope (mydatascope.com). Use this skill for ANY DataScope request — reading, creating, and updating data. Whenever a task involves DataScope, use this sk...", "description_zh": "DataScope（mydatascope.com）。任何 DataScope 请求——读取、创建和更新数据——请使用此技能。若任务涉及DataScope，即使用本技能。", "downloads": 64, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/oomol/oo-datascope", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "DataScope", "ownerName": "oomol", "score": 6543.9672801636, "slug": "oo-datascope", "source": "clawhub", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780714494285, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1780556075110, "description": "screenshot.fyi (screenshot.fyi). Use this skill fo